---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL.slice(0, -1)
  : import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="lua-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-top-badges">
      <span class="badge badge-orange">🤖 Hardware AIoT</span>
      <span class="badge badge-cyan">🔗 Bluetooth 5.0 LE</span>
      <span class="badge badge-purple">✨ Refuerzo Conductual</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-title">
      Lúa: Tu mascota inteligente <br/><span class="gradient-text-orange">en casa y en la clínica.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-subtitle">
      Lúa es una mascota robótica diseñada para acompañar a los niños en su neurodesarrollo. En casa, facilita la <strong>rehabilitación motivando el aprendizaje</strong> (Valeria+); en la consulta, se convierte en un asistente silencioso que <strong>recompensa las pruebas audiológicas</strong> sin interferir (VIA+).
    </p>

    <!-- Hardware Abstract Representation -->
    <div class="hardware-abstract">
      <div class="hardware-circle">
        <div class="ips-screen-placeholder">
          <div class="face-eye left"></div>
          <div class="face-eye right"></div>
          <div class="face-smile"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hardware-glow"></div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .lua-hero {
    padding-top: 130px;
    padding-bottom: 60px;
    text-align: center;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top center, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.05), transparent 60%);
  }

  .hero-top-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .badge-orange {
    background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3);
    color: #f97316;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem auto;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .gradient-text-orange {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fb923c 0%, #f97316 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .hardware-abstract {
    position: relative;
    width: 240px;
    height: 240px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hardware-circle {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    background: #0f172a;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 8px solid #334155;
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8),
      0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ips-screen-placeholder {
    width: 140px;
    height: 140px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #000;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.2);
  }

  .face-eye {
    width: 15px;
    height: 35px;
    background: #f97316;
    border-radius: 20px;
    position: absolute;
    top: 35px;
    animation: blink 4s infinite;
  }

  .face-eye.left {
    left: 40px;
  }

  .face-eye.right {
    right: 40px;
  }

  .face-smile {
    width: 40px;
    height: 20px;
    border-bottom: 5px solid #f97316;
    border-radius: 0 0 40px 40px;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 35px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  @keyframes blink {
    0%, 96%, 98% { transform: scaleY(1); }
    97% { transform: scaleY(0.1); }
  }

  .hardware-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 240px;
    height: 240px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    z-index: 1;
    animation: pulse 3s infinite ease-in-out;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); opacity: 0.5; }
    50% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.1); opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); opacity: 0.5; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
